Package: upgrade-guard
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: read-only Ubuntu release-upgrade readiness assistant
 Upgrade Guard inspects read-only package, platform, storage, kernel, DKMS,
 Secure Boot and reboot evidence to report Ubuntu release-upgrade risks.
